  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Port-City of Limon Integrated Infrastructure Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Objective of the project is to: (i) improve the protection and management of Limon&apos;s cultural and natural heritage; (ii) increase access to the sewage system and reduce urban flooding in the area of Limoncito; (iii) foster a more efficient, accountable and credible local government; (iv) create new employment opportunities through small and micro-enterprises; and (v) support the port modernization process and improve freight transport access to the port terminals.</narrative>
  </description>
